<title>UK: Rabobank ups 3-year bond to 150 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Rabobank ups 3-year bond to 150 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 150 million rand from 100 million rand, lead</p>
<p>manager Hambros Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT  **150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.50     MATURITY    31.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    31.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORINGINALLY LAUNCHED 03.JAN FOR 100 MLN RAND</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  GOV LAW     DUTCH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
</text>
